# 2026-08-26: FIXED by the template-clone isolation change (ADR-005) —
# a relative reference to a field the SAME pack template defines now
# answers for the child, in the expression form too, exactly as
# reference-language.md promises ("answer for the child").
# Historically it resolved at the template's own location (path showed
# a NaN key) and failed with [aontu/no_path].  Golden:
# expected/ref-in-pack-template.json (cpu "250m" per child).  Shared
# spec pin: test/spec/gen-pack.tsv pack-rel-ref-in-expr.
names: [web, auth]
deploy: pack($.names, { cpu_m: 250, cpu: .cpu_m + "m" })
